  "description": "CACGOH crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C27 H36 Cl1 Ho3 N3 O13 3+,C2 H6 O1,3(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho6 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho5 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.517-3.564 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.05-99.26°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [{Ho3(O)2(o-pbd)3Cl(H2O)5}2]·8Cl·3H2O·0.5EtOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 5 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
